{"title":"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Pick two consecutive positive integers whose sum is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />. Square both\nof those integers and then find the difference of the squares. Which of the\nfollowing could be the difference?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/b/84b1e916ef4f81e0fd2aadc7ce7b48f0bc6c6608.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 64 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 79 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 96 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 131$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"390\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the smaller of the two numbers be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Then, the problem states that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/4/9149f571dd11941b82b8a6ad5522dc0e75d31c13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+1)+x&lt;100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"139\" height=\"18\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/a/39a3a7e3364ec09496e0fd45ea47c90dc4bdf4ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+1)^2-x^2=x^2+2x+1-x^2=2x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"332\" height=\"19\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/8/6f8fc82e121c01034fef87ac28f73e7d4c0b465c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" /> is obviously odd, so only answer choices C and E need to be considered.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c57f449781e577069173bcfa5bdd23845a29f08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+1=131$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" /> contradicts the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/d/8fdeea759c5903d731683a87dbde06479040cf66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x+1&lt;100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/5/6856d39108a0530c83e14934369a8872e47cfd2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(C)} 79}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"57\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since for two consecutive numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, the difference between their squares is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/e/f7e072be5f658cb9321a64197a8124a0fa8aa0a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2-b^2=(a+b)(a-b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"185\" height=\"19\" />, which equals to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />, because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are consecutive. Because they are consecutive, one number must be even, and the other odd. Since the sum of an even and an odd number is always odd, and the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is less than 100, you can eliminate all answers except for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/5/6856d39108a0530c83e14934369a8872e47cfd2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(C)} 79}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"57\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the question we can make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca58e74505495322c1df6ed367d7149a7cde0b73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2-b^2$\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> and we can let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3dcf0896441c33c0dcf7e4616e114e9326bb6b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/f/47f63e32e27f26e66d6b918ef8cd469a92f3a47f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b&lt;100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />. First we factor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/5/ca58e74505495322c1df6ed367d7149a7cde0b73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2-b^2$\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/0/9f0fb6e96239ec6baf471889670377e0dbcf58d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b)(a-b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"106\" height=\"18\" /> and then plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/5/335645b3819e5f9c6aff352f6550f22a5e0ff637.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /> to have: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/d/26dfc414f69a4a9142a93eb1e18220479e60f057.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+a+1)(a-a+1)=(2a+1)(1)=2a+1=a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"425\" height=\"20\" />. since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> will always be an odd number, we can narrow the answers down to (C) and (E). Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/2/f52872b2faf29d4c2ac1245bffb6109fb0b8f83b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$131$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> would be too big for our range of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/f/47f63e32e27f26e66d6b918ef8cd469a92f3a47f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b&lt;100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />, we would choose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/5/6856d39108a0530c83e14934369a8872e47cfd2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(C)} 79}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"57\" height=\"29\" />. note that this solution would be better if the question was asking for the values of a and b\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/8FGl2vtO1vs\">https://youtu.be/8FGl2vtO1vs</a> Soo, DRMS, NM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/BrEqmDq82rw\">https://youtu.be/BrEqmDq82rw</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8\" title=\"2007 AMC 8\">2007 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2007\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2007 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017050811\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 225/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2272/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 132/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5424/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.024      1 -total\n 57.68%    6.935      1 Template:AMC8_box\n 40.59%    4.880      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8935:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017050811 and revision id 237726. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}